nts": [{"id": "e0017", "type": "text"}], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e0017", "type": "text", "x": 772.0, "y": 206.79999999999995, "width": 124.80000000000001, "height": 124.80000000000001, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#263238", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 37265, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 18.05, "fontFamily": 1, "text": "⑤ 管理\n1R 移保本\n跑向 BSL / 2R\n→ 4.4 / 4.13", "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "e0016", "originalText": "⑤ 管理\n1R 移保本\n跑向 BSL / 2R\n→ 4.4 / 4.13", "lineHeight": 1.3, "baseline": 16.245}, {"id": "e0018", "type": "rectangle", "x": 85.6, "y": 365.2, "width": 844.8, "height": 124.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#00897b", "backgroundColor": "#c6e5e1", "fillStyle": "hachure", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 18692, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"id": "e0019", "type": "text"}], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e0019", "type": "text", "x": 93.6, "y": 373.2, "width": 828.8, "height": 108.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#263238", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 43963, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 19.0, "fontFamily": 1, "text": "关键认知：这套流程 = 第 4 章趋势回调系统的 SMC 翻译版——语言不同，数学一样。\n画结构=趋势判断（2.4）｜等 sweep=假突破确认（3.2）｜FVG/OB=回调入场区（4.3）\n止损 SSL 外=结构止损（4.2）｜目标 BSL=前高目标（4.13）", "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "e0018", "originalText": "关键认知：这套流程 = 第 4 章趋势回调系统的 SMC 翻译版——语言不同，数学一样。\n画结构=趋势判断（2.4）｜等 sweep=假突破确认（3.2）｜FVG/OB=回调入场区（4.3）\n止损 SSL 外=结构止损（4.2）｜目标 BSL=前高目标（4.13）", "lineHeight": 1.3, "baseline": 17.1}, {"id": "title000", "type": "text", "x": 60.0, "y": 14, "width": 896.0, "height": 44, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#263238", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 99991, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 26, "fontFamily": 1, "text": "完整 SMC 交易流程（5.7）：多级别背景 → 五步执行 → 本质是第 4 章趋势回调系统的翻译版", "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "完整 SMC 交易流程（5.7）：多级别背景 → 五步执行 → 本质是第 4 章趋势回调系统的翻译版", "lineHeight": 1.3, "baseline": 23}], "appState": {"gridSize": null, "viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff", "zoom": {"value": 1}}, "files": {}}